Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:06:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/33] Plugin dock: full opacity at a press, and a lock of its
 own

Beside the dock's opacity slider, a button makes the dock fully opaque,
and the slider's value again at the next press; moving the slider lets
go of it. It is kept with the dock's other preferences.

Next to it, a lock for the dock alone. With every meter window locked
("Lock all meter windows"), it frees the dock: clicks and scrolling stay
in the plugins while the meter and the other windows let clicks through
to the game. Pressed again, the dock is locked like the rest. With the
windows free, it locks the dock alone. When the lock of all windows
changes, the dock follows it again. Both buttons stay clickable while
locked, as the dock bar's others; pressed, they show in gold.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
